Below are ten exploratory‑to‑analytic Snowflake SQL queries (each limited to 20 rows) that step from simple inspection to a final query that would deliver the requested t‑score.  
All identifiers are wrapped in double quotes, and only the two allowed tables are touched.

```sql
-- 1) Description:  List the studies represented in the RNA‑seq table
SELECT DISTINCT "Study"
FROM "PANCANCER_ATLAS_1"."PANCANCER_ATLAS_FILTERED"."EBPP_ADJUSTPANCAN_ILLUMINAHISEQ_RNASEQV2_GENEXP_FILTERED"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description:  Preview DRG2 expression rows in the LGG study
